{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Astro Pack - DLC Models Package</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This DLC package expands your sci-fi TTRPG world-building and gameplay with a detailed collection of 3D models perfect for any spaceship-based adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-50+ Spaceships and Satellites <br>-Huge Collection of parts to build\u00a0your own ships, satellites and buildings.<br>-50+ Planets<br>-Space VFXs <br>-And more...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Multiplayer Compatibility</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you're a Game Master using this package, your players can view your maps online even if they don't own it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Disclaimer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This package is <u><strong>included</strong></u> in the Wrath of Devs Expansion. If you have backed that campaign, then you do not need to purchase this.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3577660?t=1741863458","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577660/a834c0c4f12e3d57d407293f0cc492fdb1d0183c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741863458","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577660/cc207ae22ac6839d51fb54a8f2daa36be59abe03/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741863458","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577660/cc207ae22ac6839d51fb54a8f2daa36be59abe03/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741863458","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb